# 2. Upload to your public_html/ directory via FileZilla
# 3. Make sure Node.js app is running in hPanel
# 4. Test by visiting: https://modenlo.com/api/health
# 5. If you get 502 errors, the port might not be 3000
#    - In that case, use .htaccess.HOSTINGER_PORT instead
